  "description": "<p><strong>ABOUT US...</strong></p>\r\n<p>Our innovative short handle design is all about the \"pinch grip\", widely considered by chefs and instructors as the proper way to hold a kitchen knife.&nbsp; Great ergonomics and balanced design lead to more efficient chopping, slicing, and dicing!</p>\r\n<p>But we're not just a knife with a small handle...</p>\r\n<p>Each blade is crafted with super-strong forged German steel and double-sharpened to a razor-sharp edge.&nbsp; A single piece of steel from tip to handle offers ultimate strength and durability.&nbsp; And the military grade handles are non-porous, won't fade or crack, and are a breeze to keep clean.</p>\r\n<p>We're excited to offer a truly innovative and quality-crafted kitchen knife and invite you to experience it for yourself!</p>\r\n<p>-FINI</p>",
